Id: rlog003w
Severity: WARN
Category: logging
Check: check_remotelog
Fix: Rename it to end in .conf, or move its rules where rsyslog reads.
References: rsyslog.conf(5)

A file in rsyslog's includes directory will never be read, because its
name does not match the glob the configuration includes (usually
*.conf: no .bak, no README, no files without a suffix). Rules put
there in the belief they run do not.
